    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boogey Hunters</strong> is a strategic ammo-building game that takes players on a thrilling global journey to hunt down terrifying mythical creatures, known as boogeys, from different folklores. As a skilled hunter, you must travel the world, carefully plan your movements, and engage in tactical combat to rid each country of its unique boogey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/27b15c0dc7051af86ad2d2205fd69b46.poster.avif?t=1752641502\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/27b15c0dc7051af86ad2d2205fd69b46.webm?t=1752641502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/27b15c0dc7051af86ad2d2205fd69b46.mp4?t=1752641502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IN HOW MANY DAYS CAN YOU SAVE THE WORLD?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel around the world strategically.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage time wisely. Every action causes a day to pass, and boogeys grow stronger each day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/f4972ee660ff589cdf4c8c5bae18f2c2.poster.avif?t=1752641502\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/f4972ee660ff589cdf4c8c5bae18f2c2.webm?t=1752641502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/f4972ee660ff589cdf4c8c5bae18f2c2.mp4?t=1752641502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover folklore and mythical creatures from different cultures. Boogeyman, Jersey Devil, Baba Yaga, Cuca, El Hombre Del Saco and many more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HUNT ALL MYTHICAL CREATURES WITH BULLETS AND DICES!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly powerful boogeys as they evolve through different phases.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in tactical deck-building combat with unique bullet combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/ea551d3b9e41053eac5cc37040f759d9.poster.avif?t=1752641502\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/ea551d3b9e41053eac5cc37040f759d9.webm?t=1752641502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/ea551d3b9e41053eac5cc37040f759d9.mp4?t=1752641502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The effects of certain bullets are determined by dice mechanic. Believe your luck and roll the dice.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a challenging single-player experience with deep strategy and replayability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/2c65bcbdcc1c052ad7e1718137894f40.poster.avif?t=1752641502\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/2c65bcbdcc1c052ad7e1718137894f40.webm?t=1752641502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/2c65bcbdcc1c052ad7e1718137894f40.mp4?t=1752641502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boogey Hunters</strong> is a strategic ammo-building game that takes players on a thrilling global journey to hunt down terrifying mythical creatures, known as boogeys, from different folklores. As a skilled hunter, you must travel the world, carefully plan your movements, and engage in tactical combat to rid each country of its unique boogey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/27b15c0dc7051af86ad2d2205fd69b46.poster.avif?t=1752641502\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/27b15c0dc7051af86ad2d2205fd69b46.webm?t=1752641502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/27b15c0dc7051af86ad2d2205fd69b46.mp4?t=1752641502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IN HOW MANY DAYS CAN YOU SAVE THE WORLD?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel around the world strategically.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage time wisely. Every action causes a day to pass, and boogeys grow stronger each day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/f4972ee660ff589cdf4c8c5bae18f2c2.poster.avif?t=1752641502\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/f4972ee660ff589cdf4c8c5bae18f2c2.webm?t=1752641502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/f4972ee660ff589cdf4c8c5bae18f2c2.mp4?t=1752641502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover folklore and mythical creatures from different cultures. Boogeyman, Jersey Devil, Baba Yaga, Cuca, El Hombre Del Saco and many more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HUNT ALL MYTHICAL CREATURES WITH BULLETS AND DICES!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly powerful boogeys as they evolve through different phases.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in tactical deck-building combat with unique bullet combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/ea551d3b9e41053eac5cc37040f759d9.poster.avif?t=1752641502\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/ea551d3b9e41053eac5cc37040f759d9.webm?t=1752641502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/ea551d3b9e41053eac5cc37040f759d9.mp4?t=1752641502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The effects of certain bullets are determined by dice mechanic. Believe your luck and roll the dice.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a challenging single-player experience with deep strategy and replayability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/2c65bcbdcc1c052ad7e1718137894f40.poster.avif?t=1752641502\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/2c65bcbdcc1c052ad7e1718137894f40.webm?t=1752641502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301530/extras/2c65bcbdcc1c052ad7e1718137894f40.mp4?t=1752641502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
